        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview – Fall Asleep</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fall Asleep</i> is a tense first-person climbing game where you’re trapped inside a nightmare and the only way out is up. With limited sight from your flashlight, platforms materialize just a few steps ahead, leaving you blind to the greater path and forcing you to trust your instincts. Every jump elevates you closer to escaping the dream. . . or further into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nightmare unfolds across <strong>three haunting levels</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neighborhood</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dev Tips:</strong><i> </i>Press<strong> F</strong><i> </i>to access your <i>Flashlight</i> and hold<i> </i><strong>shift</strong> to <i>Sprint</i> and make those hard-to-reach jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fall Asleep</i> makes every step a gamble. There are no checkpoints. No saves. Reaching your bed is the only way to wake yourself from the nightmare. Do you have what it takes to escape?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview – Fall Asleep</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fall Asleep</i> is a tense first-person climbing game where you’re trapped inside a nightmare and the only way out is up. With limited sight from your flashlight, platforms materialize just a few steps ahead, leaving you blind to the greater path and forcing you to trust your instincts. Every jump elevates you closer to escaping the dream. . . or further into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nightmare unfolds across <strong>three haunting levels</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neighborhood</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dev Tips:</strong><i> </i>Press<strong> F</strong><i> </i>to access your <i>Flashlight</i> and hold<i> </i><strong>shift</strong> to <i>Sprint</i> and make those hard-to-reach jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fall Asleep</i> makes every step a gamble. There are no checkpoints. No saves. Reaching your bed is the only way to wake yourself from the nightmare. Do you have what it takes to escape?</p>",
